00:00:08,268 --> 00:00:11,057
of solving some problems, of implementing

4
00:00:11,089 --> 00:00:12,259
some algorithms.

5
00:00:13,076 --> 00:00:15,319
Here we'll use nothing too special though,

6
00:00:15,352 --> 00:00:17,259
nothing too fancy for this problem.

7
00:00:17,819 --> 00:00:20,640
And this problem is called is power of 2.

8
00:00:21,585 --> 00:00:24,085
The goal is to determine whether an input

9
00:00:24,085 --> 00:00:24,454
number

10
00:00:25,015 --> 00:00:26,954
is a power of 2 or not.

11
00:00:27,531 --> 00:00:29,807
So if we would call that function that has

12
00:00:29,983 --> 00:00:31,089
